{% set resource = resources.items | find("slug", "prime-tiles-case-study") %}

{# HERO SECTION #}
<section class="bg-white pt-28 md:pt-36 pb-8 md:pb-12 px-4 md:px-6">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-orange-600 text-white text-xs font-medium tracking-wide mb-4">
        Case Study
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-[56px] font-medium text-warm-black tracking-[-0.03em] leading-[1.1] mb-5" data-reveal>
        {{ resource.title }}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-warm-600 leading-relaxed tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4" data-reveal>
        {{ resource.subtitle }}
      </p>
      <p class="text-base font-medium text-warm-black mb-4" data-reveal>
        Prime Tiles used Zunkiree Search to double its online conversion rate by matching customers to products they couldn't name exactly.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4" data-reveal>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 rounded-full">Zunkiree Search</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-warm-500" data-reveal>
        <span><strong>Client:</strong> {{ resource.client }}</span>
        <span><strong>Industry:</strong> {{ resource.industry }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# Results Bar #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 py-8 border-y border-gray-200 mb-8" data-reveal>
      {% for result in resource.results %}
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-medium text-zunkiree-600 mb-1">{{ result }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
        <div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden bg-gray-100">
          {% if resource.coverImage %}
            <img src="{{ resource.coverImage }}" alt="{{ resource.title }}" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
          {% else %}
            <div class="w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-600 to-amber-800 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="text-white/30 text-4xl font-bold">{{ resource.type }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-warm-black tracking-wide mb-6">Related Resources</h3>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <a href="/resources/mach24orbital-case-study/" class="block group">
            <p class="text-base text-zunkiree-600 group-hover:text-zunkiree-700 leading-snug mb-2">
              Case Study: Mach24 Orbital
            </p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center text-warm-black">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
          <hr class="border-warm-200">
          <a href="/resources/khems-cleaning-case-study/" class="block group">
            <p class="text-base text-zunkiree-600 group-hover:text-zunkiree-700 leading-snug mb-2">
              Case Study: Khems Cleaning
            </p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center text-warm-black">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
          <hr class="border-warm-200">
          <a href="/services/ai-ecommerce/" class="block group">
            <p class="text-base text-zunkiree-600 group-hover:text-zunkiree-700 leading-snug mb-2">
              AI Ecommerce Services
            </p>
            <span class="inline-flex items-center text-warm-black">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# CONTENT SECTION #}
<section class="relative bg-white px-4 md:px-6 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">

      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">About Prime Tiles</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed">
            <strong>Prime Tiles</strong> sells tiles and finishing materials online, where customers often don't know the exact product name or SKU they're looking for — just a rough idea of the look, size, or material they want.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The challenge</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Traditional keyword search failed customers who couldn't describe what they wanted in the exact terms the catalog used. Searches for things like "grey bathroom tiles" or "outdoor patio stone" often returned nothing useful, and customers left without buying.
          </p>
          <div class="p-6 bg-red-50 border-l-4 border-red-500">
            <p class="text-warm-600">
              <strong>Key pain points:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 text-warm-600">
              <li>• Keyword search missed products described in everyday language</li>
              <li>• Customers abandoned searches that returned no results</li>
              <li>• Large catalog made manual browsing impractical</li>
              <li>• Conversion rates lagged behind in-store sales</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The solution</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Prime Tiles deployed Zunkiree Search to power an AI-native product search experience. Customers can now describe what they want in natural language and get relevant products instantly, even without knowing exact product names.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Natural language product search</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Customers search the way they'd describe a product in person — by look, room, or material — and get relevant results.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Visual and semantic matching</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">The system understands product attributes beyond exact keyword matches, surfacing relevant alternatives.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50">
              <p class="font-medium text-warm-black mb-1">Zero-result recovery</p>
              <p class="text-warm-600 text-sm">Searches that would have returned nothing now surface the closest relevant matches instead.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">The results</h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            {% for result in resource.results %}
            <div class="p-6 bg-green-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 text-center">
              <p class="text-lg font-medium text-warm-black">{{ result }}</p>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-warm-400 mt-4">
            Illustrative results based on a representative engagement; individual outcomes vary and are not guaranteed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-10" data-reveal>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-warm-black mb-4">Why it mattered</h2>
          <p class="text-warm-600 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            A bigger keyword dictionary or more synonyms would only have covered more of the phrases Prime Tiles' team could think to anticipate — it wouldn't have covered the ones they couldn't. The fix wasn't a better list of keywords; it was a search that understands what a customer means, not just the words they happened to type.
          </p>
          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-zunkiree-600 pl-4 text-warm-700 italic">
            "We kept adding synonyms to our search index and kept missing the same customers. The problem was never the dictionary."
            <span class="block not-italic text-sm text-warm-500 mt-2">— E-commerce Manager, Prime Tiles</span>
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        {# Quote #}
        <div class="mb-10 p-8 bg-gray-50" data-reveal>
          <blockquote class="text-xl text-warm-black italic mb-4">
            "Customers were leaving because they couldn't find what they wanted in our own search bar. Now they describe the tile they're picturing and actually find it — our conversion rate doubled almost immediately."
          </blockquote>
          <p class="text-warm-600">
            <strong>E-commerce Manager</strong><br>
            Prime Tiles
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
          {% set formTitle = resource.formTitle %}
          {% set ctaText = resource.ctaText %}
          {% include "components/lead-capture-form.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

